There are dinners… and then there’s Fire Feast at Oliver Farms. From Michelin-recognized chefs working their craft over open flames to the heritage woven into every corner of the land, it was proof that some meals become beautiful memories. Set against 90 acres of rolling fields, century-old fruit trees, and a barn dating back to the 1830s, the night honoured both the beauty of fire and the heritage of the land… every detail felt like magic. ✨ And then strolling up to the 150-year-old apple tree for mint juleps at sunset felt straight out of a dream!  Huge love to Gold & Fife Events for pulling it all together (who has more unforgettable events coming to Prince Edward County 👀). Both @myoliverfarmhouse + @goldandfife_ are must-follows if you love incredible food, breathtaking settings, and nights that leave you in awe. ⁣
