Who says fundraising always has to mean simply asking for money? Sometimes, it looks like gathering over a beautiful meal and raising awareness for vital causes like Parkdale Food Centre (@parkdalefood). Last week’s fundraising dinner at North & Navy was a heartwarming evening of shared stories and a deeper understanding of the important work PFC does. It also reminded us that giving can be creative—and deeply communal.⁣
⁣
There are many ways to support PFC: become a monthly donor, volunteer in the kitchen, join their community meals, or get creative and host your own event. Time, talent, elbow grease—it all makes a difference. Reach out to PFC and get involved!⁣
