Wakefield is always a good idea 🤗 And no matter what the season, there is always something to offer. From the artsy vibes and the thriving outdoor scene at Vorlage, to all the delicious eats and Klimat’s new bouldering gym bringing in fresh faces...this town is an absolute gem! It’s only a 30 minute drive from downtown Ottawa and each time I visit, I tell myself I need to go there more often. 🍁 With so much growth happening, imagine the possibilities at the historic Les Trois Erables (@lestroiserables)- a 6-bedroom inn, each room with a full ensuite, just waiting for someone to live out their Gilmore Girls dream. How cool would it be to use this spot to create a wellness retreat, co-housing project, or a boutique clinic surrounded by all that tranquility and beauty 😍 The potential here is endless, really, Hit up @ericabernstein_realtor for any info on Wakefield real estate and be sure to check out these spots when you visit Wakefield this fall or winter:⁣
